OL,3,A'Tirana teeth': Albania hopes to be the
OL,4,Anew Turkey for dental work
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnthony Hook is sitting in a dentist's
OL,7,Fchair, grinning toothily into a
OL,8,Fhandheld mirror. He has been asked to
OL,9,Fpose for photos showing off his new
OL,10,Fsmile ` and he is only too happy to
OL,11,Foblige.
OL,13,FThe 58-year-old window cleaner from
OL,14,FBolton, in Greater Manchester, is the
OL,15,Fproud owner of a sparkling new set of
OL,16,F"Tirana teeth".
OL,18,FThat is not a brand name ` at least,
OL,19,Fnot yet. But it would be a fitting
OL,20,Fslogan as Albania moves decisively into
OL,21,Fthe medical tourism business.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
