OL,3,A'Tirana teeth': Albania hopes to be the
OL,4,Anew Turkey for dental work
OL,5,
OL,6,FTirana, its capital city, is the focus
OL,7,Fof operations. And once you spot the
OL,8,Ffirst tooth, you start seeing them
OL,9,Feverywhere. They seem to be all over
OL,10,Fthe city centre.
